      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.33 (vs ₹0.75 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.33 (down from ₹0.75 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹341.1m (down 21% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹3.89m (down 53% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.1% (down from 1.9% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 72% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 45% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
